, $u\\times v=0$ if and only if $u∥v.$\n\nSince the angle between $u$ and $v$ is ${0}^{∘},$ our vectors must be parallel. \n\nTherefore, $u\\times v=0.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-146304/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "82f31c6e-f9df-5e0a-88a4-a8ccfca00258"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-146304"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-146318/selection/d2946d3a01784e4042101fa3946b5de7418c0f153f529324667d43464b7d61de" :answer/id #uuid "84e7051d-3d50-5942-957f-02499c983754" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "22v" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-146318/selection/851d57512301eabe38978afa77d3577f20c22f9603409229e9944f1adbe12a5a" :answer/id #uuid "98c4ea37-a45d-5542-9544-8258296d9972" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12w" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-146318/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "4821ed81-c26f-5644-9c07-8587174e419d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-146318/selection/962b1ca714185a1de7f36b606dd5cbbfc5dddad1355d7b4e81055570d26a9713" :answer/id #uuid "d25eeda5-2d5b-54f6-8fe0-b6692dd1e6d9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "120w" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-146318/selection/f04a4c4ed05ea367e18d94e749b7483d750fd8073bca1fea38a66236786ef14c" :answer/id #uuid "237f126f-8cee-5aba-96a2-26794995ea27" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10v" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-146318/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "95792031-857a-5e51-965a-bd999bb373e4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-146318/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer-field/choices ["q-146318/selection/d2946d3a01784e4042101fa3946b5de7418c0f153f529324667d43464b7d61de" "q-146318/selection/851